lett \"tries out a variety of cross-sections and settings, mosaics and micro-narratives,\" as Robert Gordon wrote in Literary Review. It won the Samuel Johnson Prize, the Duff Cooper Prize, and the Costa Book Award for Biography.","matchedBy":"infobox_book:high","confidence":"high","attribution":{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Pike%3A_Gabriele_D'Annunzio%2C_Poet%2C_Seducer_and_Preacher_of_War","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"},"infobox":{"title":"The Pike: Gabriele d'Annunzio, Poet, Seducer and Preacher of War","author":"Lucy Hughes-Hallett","publisher":"Fourth Estate","publicationDate":"January 1, 2013","pages":"694","isbn":"9780007213962"},"publisherEvidenceId":"publisher-evidence-wikipedia-the-pike-gabriele-d-annunzio-poet-seducer-and-preacher-of-war-lucy-hughes-hallett"},"sources":[{"id":"source-award-record-baillie-gifford-nonfiction-wikipedia-baillie-gifford-prize","label":"Wikipedia: Baillie Gifford Prize","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baillie_Gifford_Prize","accessedAt":"2026-08-03T17:09:58.257Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official awards URL: https://www.thebailliegiffordprize.co.uk/"},{"id":"source-award-record-costa-biography-wikipedia-costa-book-award-for-biography","label":"Wikipedia: Costa Book Award for Biography","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Costa_Book_Award_for_Biography","accessedAt":"2026-08-03T17:09:58.257Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official awards URL: https://www.costabookawards.com/"},{"id":"source-award-record-duff-cooper-wikipedia-duff-cooper-prize","label":"Wikipedia: Duff Cooper Prize","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duff_Cooper_Prize","accessedAt":"2026-08-03T17:09:58.257Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official awards URL: https://www.duffcooperprize.org/"},{"id":"source-open-library-the-pike-gabriele-d-annunzio-poet-seducer-and-preacher-of-war-lucy-hughes-hallett","label":"